    "chunk_text": "Bro\u00f0or \u00fea leofestan, ic cy\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fereo \u00feing synt \u00e6rest on foreweardum \u00e6ghwylcum men nydbehefe to I is geleafa, o\u00f0er is hiht, \u00feridde so\u00f0 lufu. On \u00f0am geleafan is \u00fe\u00e6t he gelyfe on God, f\u00e6der \u00e6lmihtigne, & on sunu & on \u00feone halgan gast & on \u00fea \u00deonne is se hiht \u00fe\u00e6t he wislice gehihte \u00fea ecan meda. \u00deonne is seo so\u00f0e lufu \u00fe\u00e6t he sie gefylled mid \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan lufan & his nehstan. For \u00feam \u00fee we sint ealle on \u00feam fulluhte Godes bearn gehalgode, to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t we sien gastlice gebro\u00f0or \u00d0y we sceolon symle wunian on \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan lufan & ures nehstan, \u00fe\u00e6t he symle on us \u00feurhwunige, Bro\u00f0or mine, VI \u00feing synt nydebehefe to habbanne \u00fe\u00e6re halgan cristenlican \u00e6wf\u00e6stnesse & ealra m\u00e6st I is andetnes, o\u00f0er is hreowsung, \u00feridde is w\u00e6cce, feor\u00fee is f\u00e6sten, V sint gebedu, VI is \u00e6lmesse. Sio andetnes is to donne be eallum \u00feam sinnum \u00fee man aw\u00f0er \u00feurhtyh\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e an ge\u00feohte o\u00f0\u00f0e on Witodlice eahta synt heafodleahtras, butan \u00feara sumon ne m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man unea\u00f0lice gemet bion. \u00c6rest is \u00fe\u00e6t forme gifernes \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6re wambe frecnes, o\u00f0er is dyrne geligre, \u00feridde is sleacmodnes & \u00deurh \u00fea oferhygde of heofonum gehreas \u00fe\u00e6t",
